{
    "word": "ginseng",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                "word": "ginseng",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ef63d9f5-a84b-417e-996b-6c74286d8948",
                        "entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ginsengs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b90b68d-3936-328b-a084-ed1f4b0c8647",
                        "entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any plant of two species of the genus Panax (Panax ginseng and Panax quinquefolius), having forked roots supposed to have medicinal and aphrodisiac properties."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6922550-8c02-3ca4-902b-1d17008dacda",
                        "entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The root of such a plant, or an extract of these roots."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e22554ad-9673-4c51-a488-2492a707bf83",
                                "sense_id": "b6922550-8c02-3ca4-902b-1d17008dacda",
                                "text": "When the Afghan princes find it necessary to employ Chob-Chini, (the Jin-seng, or China root so celebrated as a purifier, tonic, and aphrodisiac) they choose the spring season."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb8059c1-2351-47f1-8d01-17216bbedd46",
                                "sense_id": "b6922550-8c02-3ca4-902b-1d17008dacda",
                                "text": "Athletes' use of herbal supplements has skyrocketed in the past two decades. At the top of the list of popular herbs are echinacea and ginseng, whereas garlic, St. John's wort, soybean, ephedra and others are also surging in popularity or have been historically prevalent."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d6fef30-051d-414e-89f5-2d08b03f9cc6",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "source_sense_description": "any of several plants, of the genus Panax",
                        "target_lang_word": "ženšen",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34cb5fd3-0040-4cce-bdc2-1c05f6503569",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "source_sense_description": "any of several plants, of the genus Panax",
                        "target_lang_word": "ginseng",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ginseng",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ada0a842-6726-38c3-8cb5-10a117bce13d",
                                        "entry_id": "761b33cb-5b9e-35ae-8664-8faa296da729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Panax ginseng bereidingen uit de wortels van soorten uit het geslacht Panax in de Klimopfamilie (Araliaceae)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e551aae-347e-496b-9a60-7cafe529fb67",
                                                "sense_id": "ada0a842-6726-38c3-8cb5-10a117bce13d",
                                                "text": "De 'wijn' is te vinden bij verschillende merken. Zo heeft het merk Woof&Brew een pawsecco. Je trouwe vriend kan kiezen uit de kleuren wit en rosé. Beide wijntjes zijn gemaakt van vlierbloesem, lindebloesem en ginseng, alleen is de rosé ook nog aangevuld met wortel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b0a652b-0bee-41d8-885e-ccd092c59c91",
                                                "sense_id": "ada0a842-6726-38c3-8cb5-10a117bce13d",
                                                "text": "Gangnam telt duizenden koffiewinkels zodat je niet gauw vermoeid raakt. In de grote modewarenhuizen is een energiedrankje snel gescoord. En de ginseng-thee staat op strategische punten klaar. Maar het meest stimulerend werkt toch de amicale sfeer. In de winkels die ’streetware’ verkopen, word je steevast begroet met ’hey brother’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7da49cb-f940-46de-b662-290262e4dc7f",
                                                "sense_id": "ada0a842-6726-38c3-8cb5-10a117bce13d",
                                                "text": "In een top tien van kruidenpreparaten die volgens het RIVM risico's opleveren bij medicijngebruik staan: sint-janskruid, zonnehoed, knoflook, kava, ginkgo, geelwortel, danshen, Amerikaanse ginseng, valeriaan en groene thee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf2c3f40-08b1-40f6-870d-955f05109e18",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "source_sense_description": "any of several plants, of the genus Panax",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ginseng",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ginseng",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1897a130-2f50-3e29-861c-a908cdc1c1a2",
                                        "entry_id": "b6d45759-9981-3982-9d60-08ea94d14b03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in Asien beheimatete Pflanze, deren Wurzeln für die Zubereitung von Arzneimitteln und speziell Aphrodisiaka verwendet werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d061887c-d061-4b85-97ac-f0a1749b2017",
                                                "sense_id": "1897a130-2f50-3e29-861c-a908cdc1c1a2",
                                                "text": "„In China gilt der Ginseng als das vorzüglichste Vorbauungs- und Heilmittel gegen die Cholera und choleraähnliche Zustände.“ (1860)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fafbae10-ac3e-4610-ae51-2d345955a50b",
                                                "sense_id": "1897a130-2f50-3e29-861c-a908cdc1c1a2",
                                                "text": "„Ginseng stärkt unter anderem die Immunabwehr, regt den Stoffwechsel an, fördert die Leistungsfähigkeit und Potenz. Er hilft bei depressiven Verstimmungen und Wechseljahrsbeschwerden von Männern ebenso wie von Frauen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72b953e4-a93a-44f9-81fb-27cca46eacdf",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "source_sense_description": "any of several plants, of the genus Panax",
                        "target_lang_word": "żeń-szeń",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "żeń-szeń",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72f54ac4-c313-3d18-bcc7-fa38ebb32bdb",
                                        "entry_id": "1f928ae0-0ccf-3b08-9f0d-ed8134aebfb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "azjatycka bylina zielna uprawiana ze względu na korzenie wykorzystywane w medycynie, kosmetyce oraz jako przyprawa"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfb7c408-175f-4f03-99e7-d3bce6fa05e7",
                                                "sense_id": "72f54ac4-c313-3d18-bcc7-fa38ebb32bdb",
                                                "text": "W dziewiętnastym wieku wartość suchego korzenia żeń-szenia osiemnastokrotnie przekraczała wartość złota."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e5e0954-ed0e-321c-a236-f4bc71f2e74c",
                                        "entry_id": "1f928ae0-0ccf-3b08-9f0d-ed8134aebfb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "korzeń żeń-szenia (1.1)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bbb5c49-51df-44d7-8cb0-7f376a8819d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f29dc85-ee7d-3984-b949-d2d6e93337a9",
                        "source_sense_description": "any of several plants, of the genus Panax",
                        "target_lang_word": "wszechlek",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
